that off at the source.

334
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:30,637
After capturing Caesar and
destroying his lab on Punk Hazard,

335
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:33,308
any further smile
development was shut down.

336
00:24:37,340 --> 00:24:42,757
after that we destroyed doflamingo's
factory and dress rosa this

337
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:48,437
shut down production and trade
distribution of smile in no time now

338
00:24:48,520 --> 00:24:52,157
kaido's business partner is not
only dethroned but locked in prison

339
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:59,160
so in the simplest terms possible
we picked a fight with kaido

