if he can't control his
emotions our plan will fail

357
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,230
them.

358
00:26:22,313 --> 00:26:24,460
We need the entire alliance with us.

359
00:26:24,660 --> 00:26:26,537
That is the only way we can succeed.

360
00:26:26,620 --> 00:26:27,500
I can

361
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:35,957
pull this together somehow.

362
00:26:36,040 --> 00:26:36,870
Now, room.

363
00:26:36,953 --> 00:26:39,077
In the meantime, stay out of sight.

364
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,380
It shambles.

365
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:43,060
Be careful!

366
00:26:51,900 --> 00:26:53,077
Damn it, Luffy.

367
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:55,900
We weren't apart that
long. What did you do?

368
00:27:12,520 --> 00:27:15,017
