they still believe that

430
00:32:16,900 --> 00:32:20,197
that the kozuki samurai
will come back for revenge

431
00:32:20,280 --> 00:32:23,817
from beyond the grave just
in time for the anniversary

432
00:32:23,900 --> 00:32:27,157
huh indeed which i'm
certain has become a great

433
