cause of stress for the
shogun so destroying that

434
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:33,384
castle would kill two
birds with with one stone.

435
00:32:38,340 --> 00:32:41,100
Old Odin castle, huh?

436
00:32:53,420 --> 00:32:55,460
That brings back memories.

437
00:32:56,100 --> 00:32:58,420
It's a fine hiding place indeed.

438
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,720
But not anymore.

439
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:08,537
you're thinking punks
can get away with what

440
00:33:08,620 --> 00:33:13,080
you've done taking my smile
fruits away didn't stop

